WEBVTT

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.380
FEDERAL DEMOCRATIC REPUBLIC OF NEPAL

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.050
This is Nepal.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.180
<i>In the Himalayas,</i>
<i>5,000 meters above sea level,</i>

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.850
<i>there is a tribal village.</i>

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:27.860
<i>A boy used to live there,</i>
<i>called the "monstrous child."</i>

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.110
<i>His name was Haru.</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:33.860
HARU, 15 YEARS OLD

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:39.450
<i>He was the leader of the village</i>
<i>and the tribe's strongest warrior.</i>

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:45.580
<i>I found a lot of goats,</i>
<i>so caught some for you all.</i>

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.800
<i>A few years later...</i>

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:51.460
<i>Oh, you're really quite big!</i>

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:52.880
AKIO KOHNO
A MAN FROM JAPAN

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:57.180
<i>Come to Japan with me, Haru.</i>

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:00.600
<i>I have no doubt you will</i>
<i>become the mightiest kengan fighter.</i>

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:05.770
<i>He described what a kengan match</i>
<i>was to Haru...</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:07.900
<i>and told him he was looking for a fighter.</i>

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>He also told Haru that he'd come to Nepal</i>
<i>because he'd heard rumors about him.</i>

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.240
<i>I've been dreaming for a long time...</i>

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.990
<i>about fighting with my full force,</i>
<i>even just once.</i>

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:22.040
<i>But if I leave...</i>

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.790
<i>What's bothering you?</i>

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:28.790
<i>Everyone here in the village</i>
<i>will always support you.</i>

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>You guys...</i>

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:36.300
<i>-This village is too small for you.</i>
<i>-Sir...</i>

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:41.050
<i>Go and see the outside world</i>
<i>with your own eyes, Haru.</i>

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:44.930
<i>It's always been your dream</i>
<i>to fight all out, hasn't it?</i>

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:47.640
<i>This isn't our last goodbye.</i>

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:52.440
<i>You can come back anytime,</i>
<i>after you've woken from this dream. </i>Okay?

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:59.620
<i>The man went back to Japan,</i>
<i>taking Haru with him.</i>

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:05.160
<i>He immediately adopted Haru</i>
<i>and secured Japanese citizenship for him.</i>

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:10.630
<i>What's this? Is a festival taking place?</i>

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:13.300
<i>There are so many more people</i>
<i>here than in my village.</i>

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.380
<i>Is that what they call a building?</i>

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.840
<i>It's bigger than the Himalayas!</i>

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.890
<i>Here comes some fatty tuna!</i>

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:22.010
<i>What kind of meat is this?</i>

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:25.850
<i>D... Delicious!</i>

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:29.480
<i>You can get food in this country</i>
<i>without having to hunt for it?</i>

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:33.320
<i>The picture's moving! No, go right!</i>

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:36.070
<i>Damn it! This monster turtle...</i>

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:39.200
<i>You're so easily blown away,</i>
<i>you dumb hick.</i>

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.950
<i>I'll hypnotize you with all this trash</i>
<i>and turn you into my puppet.</i>

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:45.410
<i>And now...</i>

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:51.040
<i>A life of satisfaction and overindulgence</i>
<i>can sometimes turn poisonous.</i>

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:58.010
<i>The poison of a luxurious lifestyle has</i>
<i>steadily corroded Haru's spirit.</i>

00:02:58.220 --> 00:02:59.380
<i>Don't mess me around!</i>

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:06.100
<i>And then, Haru became Haruo.</i>

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:08.180
SAYAKA KATAHARA
METSUDO KATAHARA'S DAUGHTER

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.890
<i>Let's welcome the fighters!</i>

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:18.280
GAME TWO

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:21.110
<i>A hitman from the game industry.</i>

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:26.240
The strongest game-loving hermit
in history is about to walk into the ring.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:30.620
<i>Let's see if he can triumph</i>
<i>at every stage of the tournament!</i>

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:35.920
<i>Standing 242 cm tall</i>
<i>and weighing 315 kg,</i>

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:39.130
<i>his kengan match record is</i>
<i>four wins and no losses.</i>

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:45.140
He has acquired total assets
of 301 billion, 246 million yen.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.140
Representing Nentendo,

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:50.140
<i>also known as "The Destroyer,"</i>

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:54.560
<i>Haruo Kohno!</i>

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:03.740
KAZUO YAMASHITA
PRESIDENT, YAMASHITA CORP.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.950
He's gigantic!

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.330
HARUO KOHNO
FIGHTER, NENTENDO

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:14.790
-Hey... give me a snack.
-Not right now, okay?

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.290
Wow, he really is tremendously big.

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.090
SHUNKA HIYAMA
PRESIDENT, WAKASA INSURANCE

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:20.960
Akoya.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:22.670
<i>Can you hear me?</i>

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:25.090
Yeah, no problem.

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:29.680
<i>-Great.</i>
-Let's go, Hiyama.

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:35.600
<i>The supreme power of the state</i>
<i>is here on Ganryu Island.</i>

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:38.650
Nothing can break his iron-hard body.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:42.400
<i>Nothing can fluster his stone-cold heart.</i>

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:45.360
<i>He heads up the riot squad,</i>

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:48.700
<i>the most fearsome unit</i>
<i>in the Metropolitan Police Dept.</i>

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:53.080
<i>Standing 191 cm tall</i>
<i>and weighing 114 kg,</i>

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:56.960
<i>his kengan match record is</i>
<i>39 wins and no losses.</i>

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:03.010
He has amassed total assets
of 191 billion, 115 million yen.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:07.260
Representing Wakasa Life Insurance,
also known as "The Executioner,"

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:10.560
<i>Seishu Akoya!</i>

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:18.150
SEISHU AKOYA
FIGHTER, WAKASA LIFE INSURANCE

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:21.730
It's time to enforce justice.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:56.910
JUSTICE

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:10.130
That guy is strong.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:11.720
RINO KURAYOSHI & REI MIKAZUCHI

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.010
It's a different block...
but we should still be careful.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:15.680
GENSAI KUROKI
FIGHTER, MOTOR HEAD MOTORS

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:16.930
Rei, you're very vigilant.

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:18.680
RYO INABA
FIGHTER, PENASONIC CORPORATION

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:20.890
WAKASA LIFE INSURANCE COMPANY

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:24.650
MUTEBA GIZENGA
FIGHTER, IWAMI HEAVY INDUSTRIES

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:27.780
Seems the thugs noticed it, too.
It's strange, isn't it?

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:32.910
Why do you think we feel like that
policeman has a similar aura to our own?

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.870
<i>It's the battle of the Destroyer</i>
<i>versus the Executioner.</i>

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:39.540
<i>-Let's see which one will survive!</i>
-Get set!

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.460
Fight!

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.210
I've started analyzing.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.340
LIHITO

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:52.380
OHMA TOKITA

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:53.340
That fatso moves fast.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:55.850
<i>He's not just a big pig.</i>

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.230
KAEDE AKIYAMA
NOGI, CHAIRMAN'S SECRETARY

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:03.270
He did a backflip!

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:05.610
JERRY TYSON, FIGHTER, 22ND CENTURY FAX
(ELIMINATED)

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:08.530
Kohno throws his huge body
around effortlessly,

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.070
<i>while weighing over 300 kg!</i>

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:18.280
He knocked up against him!

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:22.870
<i>Akoya has been smashed into the wall!</i>

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:28.250
I want to play video games...

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:30.760
How is he able to move that way?

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:35.220
Haruo Kohno truly is a monster,
he's so much worse than I'd heard.

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:37.760
Do you know him, Ms. Akiyama?

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:41.930
There was a battle royal before,

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:44.270
for the right to develop
the next generation of consoles.

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:48.020
<i>Every company sent</i>
<i>their strongest fighters</i>

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:52.280
<i>but the result was a resounding victory</i>
<i>for Haruo Kohno from Nentendo.</i>

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:53.780
Great, Haruo.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:55.030
AKIO KOHNO
PRESIDENT, NENTENDO

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:57.660
Finish him off quickly.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:03.120
<i>Ridiculous.</i>

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:04.710
RIDICULOUS

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.880
SAW PAING YOROIZUKA
FIGHTER, VILLAGE OF DAWN

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:14.340
-Hey, he fended it off.
-That's the Great Shield.

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:16.010
GAOLAN WONGSAWAT
FIGHTER, YAZU TRADING

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:18.850
I’ve got it, he uses the "art of arrest"
as his fighting style.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.510
<i>Art of arrest.</i>

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:26.520
<i>Police officers in charge of criminal</i>
<i>investigations acquire this martial art</i>

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:30.860
<i>which specializes in restraining</i>
<i>and subduing the opponent.</i>

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:32.320
<i>It was developed</i>

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:35.400
<i>by mixing Japanese kung fu,</i>
<i>the Japanese art of fencing, and jujitsu,</i>

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:41.160
<i>to fight not only with bare hands</i>
<i>but also using various weapons.</i>

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:44.120
<i>He's just like a gladiator.</i>

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:48.210
<i>Still, it doesn't mean</i>
<i>he's immune to damage.</i>

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:52.590
<i>Is his body made of steel?</i>

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:57.130
Why isn't he falling down?

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:03.220
He slashed his arm!

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:06.810
It looks like Lihito's Razor's Edge.

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:09.310
What the hell did you do?

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:16.150
That technique is radically different
to my Razor's Edge.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:20.160
He cuts his opponent's skin
using his knuckles.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:21.700
You're a stubborn pig.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:25.200
I don't think he's badly injured,
despite the fact he's bleeding a lot.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.960
I'd say it's more of
a harassment technique.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.830
-What's wrong, Tokita?
-I'm going to bed.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:33.880
You don't want to watch the match?

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.340
Neither of them are serious.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:38.970
It'd be a waste of time
watching them fight.

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:43.600
Not serious?

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:46.350
<i>Akoya, I'm done.</i>

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:49.810
-I've finished analyzing.
<i>-Roger.</i>

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:51.860
Let's finish this.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:56.690
BEAR KILLER

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:00.530
LOW RIGHT FOOT EDGE KICK

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:02.910
LOW LEFT PUNCH

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:05.330
RIGHT PALM HEEL PUNCH

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:10.670
<i>A counter!</i>

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.080
Haruo!

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:14.090
You bastar--

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:20.220
Wow! Akoya's stream of attacks
just won't stop!

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:24.260
I hate you!

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.560
<i>He surely can't escape this!</i>

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:37.480
It's not fair to take off your clothes!

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:38.650
Just surrender.

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:42.240
Your attacks won't reach me anymore.

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:46.530
For the sake of justice,
you shall die right now.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:54.960
<i>You guys are unlucky.</i>
<i>You pissed off our boss.</i>

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:56.420
<i>Stop this now.</i>

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:02.260
<i>I am going to enforce justice.</i>

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.560
<i>That was a close one.</i>

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:10.890
<i>They sent their hatchet men after us</i>
<i>just for stealing their boss's car.</i>

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:12.890
<i>They're crazy!</i>

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:15.270
<i>And... who are you?</i>

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.900
<i>Shoot me.</i>
<i>I'll let you go if you can kill me.</i>

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:21.110
<i>What?</i>

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:24.950
<i>You jerks stole a car belonging</i>
<i>to the boss of a yakuza group.</i>

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:29.080
<i>Then, while you were escaping,</i>
<i>you knocked someone down.</i>

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:32.040
<i>Luckily, the victim was</i>
<i>only slightly injured.</i>

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.870
<i>But I don't give a shit about that.</i>

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.630
<i>That's not sufficient reason</i>
<i>to let scum like you live.</i>

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:42.010
<i>That's insane.</i>
<i>You're going to kill me just for that?</i>

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:45.680
If you want to kill someone,
kill those yakuza bastards instead!

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:47.600
TADASHI KATO
LEADER OF GODO-KAI

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:50.930
<i>Don't worry.</i>
<i>They've already been executed.</i>

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:54.270
<i>You're mad!</i>

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:59.440
<i>Justice enforced.</i>

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.110
SEISHU AKOYA
CAPT. 44TH RIOT SQUAD

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:10.330
<i>Well done. Get in.</i>

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.290
SHUNKA HIYAMA
PRESIDENT, WAKASA LIFE INSURANCE

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:13.580
<i>I'll take you home.</i>

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:16.790
<i>Hiyama. I told you not to come.</i>

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:20.340
<i>So, how long are you</i>
<i>going to keep doing this?</i>

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:24.170
<i>-How about taking a break?</i>
<i>-Don't be ridiculous.</i>

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:29.180
<i>Justice doesn't rest.</i>
<i>I'll keep fighting...</i>

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.770
<i>until the day evil is finally rooted out.</i>

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:41.940
It's useless.

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:45.030
Your attacks won't hit me anymore.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:49.030
Don't you think that technique looks
quite similar to your attack prediction?

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:51.660
RYO HIMURO
GINOKUNIYA BOOKSHOP'S PREVIOUS FIGHTER

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:52.910
<i>Actually, no.</i>

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.370
SUEKICHI KANEDA
GINOKUNIYA BOOKSHOP'S CURRENT FIGHTER

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:57.790
<i>At first glance, it looks the same</i>
<i>as my attack prediction.</i>

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.920
<i>But I feel something different.</i>

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:04.010
Don't take it seriously, Haruo.
He's bluffing!

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.260
What are you waiting for, you slug?

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:08.890
You don't want to be sent back
to your country, do you?

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:12.600
<i>Return there?</i>

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:17.060
<i>To the village with no games,</i>
<i>no comics, and no computers?</i>

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:20.060
<i>No.</i>

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:22.730
I'm not going back there!

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:29.030
-He stabbed the wound!
-That rat!

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:34.160
<i>The true purpose of the technique he used</i>
<i>was to enable him to gouge the flesh.</i>

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:37.120
<i>As I thought, he's an asshole.</i>

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:44.000
TWO LIVER SHOTS

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:47.090
-Liver shots.
-That sure worked.

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:48.760
<i>Something's weird.</i>

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:52.680
<i>I don't know how to say this,</i>
<i>but Akoya looks like...</i>

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:56.180
<i>he's being manipulated by someone else.</i>

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.190
<i>Damn! Why aren't my attacks reaching him?</i>

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:09.900
MIDDLE RIGHT ROUND KICK

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:11.660
<i>Okay, perfect.</i>

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:14.620
<i>What I analyze is intervals.</i>

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:17.950
<i>In other words,</i>
<i>the timing of a person's breathing.</i>

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:21.460
<i>That's the moment a man is</i>
<i>at his most vulnerable.</i>

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:25.040
<i>Everyone has</i>
<i>their own pattern of breathing.</i>

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:30.430
<i>Using my biological clock, I analyze</i>
<i>the opponent's breathing pattern.</i>

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:34.930
<i>The signals I then send to Akoya</i>
<i>depend upon the pattern. That's it.</i>

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:39.730
<i>That's all I can do,</i>
<i>because I only have ordinary reflexes.</i>

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.230
<i>The game plan works</i>

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:47.230
<i>because my partner is Akoya and he has</i>
<i>extraordinary natural reflexes.</i>

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:51.820
<i>He is a combat machine which I manipulate.</i>

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:54.320
<i>It should even be possible for us...</i>

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:57.990
<i>to win against Fang of Metsudo now.</i>

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:04.960
<i>He's injured!</i>

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:08.380
I am strong!

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:11.010
<i>In the Himalayas,</i>

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:14.220
I am the strongest!

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:18.560
<i>-Akoya, it's time to finish him.</i>
-Understood.

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:29.230
I have no mercy for anyone
who disrupts justice.

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.530
Enforcement complete.

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:42.580
Haruo! What the hell are you doing?

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.580
You're a useless piece of crap!

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:48.590
-Stand up, Haruo!
-Can you continue, Kohno?

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:52.090
Bring a stretcher! Hurry up now!

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:53.970
The winner--

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:59.310
What the...

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:07.980
<i>He's unconscious.</i>

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:11.230
<i>But he has some murderous aura.</i>

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.240
Look at that.

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:15.490
He's back.

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:18.530
Right, chief.

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:23.500
<i>Haru, the strongest soldier of</i>
<i>the Himalayas, has come back.</i>

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:26.330
<i>I don't... lose.</i>

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:30.340
<i>A warrior... never loses.</i>

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:34.300
His fighting instinct made him get up even
though he hasn't regained consciousness.

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:38.840
Even so, a man who's been battered like
he has shouldn't be able to stand.

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:43.600
It's not a problem, Akoya.
Haruo Kohno's already been analyzed.

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:48.350
<i>No matter how many times he stands up,</i>
<i>he'll never be able to win against us.</i>

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:53.070
<i>So quick! Has his breathing changed?</i>

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:57.320
<i>The weight of his blows has increased.</i>

00:17:58.240 --> 00:18:00.580
<i>What on earth has happened to him?</i>

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:04.330
<i>Hang in there, Akoya. I'll reanalyze him.</i>

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:09.290
After moving to Japan,
he changed completely,

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:12.800
and enjoyed a luxurious lifestyle.

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:18.130
But that is the true form of Haru,
the strongest of all Gurkhas.

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:19.550
GURKHA SOLDIERS

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:22.600
<i>Gurkha soldiers are</i>
<i>a fierce band of mercenaries.</i>

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:26.180
<i>The mixed troop consists</i>
<i>of several mountain tribes.</i>

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:29.440
<i>Having been raised in</i>
<i>the harshest of environments,</i>

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:33.400
<i>they possess a toughness which those</i>
<i>living in the lowlands can never match.</i>

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:37.990
<i>Throughout history, political leaders</i>
<i>from all over the world have hired them.</i>

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:42.950
<i>One man was said to be</i>
<i>the strongest of all Gurkha soldiers.</i>

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:48.160
<i>They feared him, believing him</i>
<i>to be the incarnation of Indra.</i>

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.120
<i>That man is Haru.</i>

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:56.210
He's unstoppable!

00:18:56.340 --> 00:19:00.130
Kohno continues his
one-sided pummelling of Akoya.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:03.720
<i>Is this the same man who was</i>
<i>on the backfoot only minutes ago?</i>

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:06.180
<i>I need a little more time.</i>

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:10.020
<i>Sorry, Akoya.</i>
<i>Hang in there for a few more minutes.</i>

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:13.940
Hurry up, Hiyama.
You don't have much time.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:16.440
Gee, what a spectacle!

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:19.030
Wait, what's that?

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.700
His face looks...

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:27.870
<i>Greed is a deadly poison</i>
<i>that corrupts people.</i>

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:32.750
<i>His emerging instinct</i>
<i>as the God of War is rejecting the poison.</i>

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.840
<i>His speed has increased again.</i>

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:40.930
-I need to recalculate.
<i>-You don't need to.</i>

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:43.510
<i>Time's up, Hiyama.</i>

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:47.560
<i>Wow, look at those fierce punches!</i>

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.810
<i>He's raining blows down upon him</i>
<i>like a pneumatic hammer!</i>

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:53.520
<i>Is there nothing left for Akoya to do?</i>

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.650
Can you hear me, Akoya?

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:02.030
I can finish analyzing in 15...
No, 12 seconds. Please, Akoya.

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:04.160
<i>Follow my command.</i>

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:05.700
<i>Save your breath, Hiyama.</i>

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:08.790
<i>I told you, time's up.</i>

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:13.960
<i>Haruo Kohno will die...</i>
<i>because of your incompetence.</i>

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.090
<i>Haruo Kohno.</i>

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:20.970
<i>You must die for justice.</i>

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:24.760
It hurts!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:30.470
<i>His knee has already</i>
<i>reached its critical limit.</i>

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:36.230
<i>It must've always been under massive</i>
<i>strain due to his great weight.</i>

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:40.150
<i>In addition, it's taken a</i>
<i>tremendous kicking from Akoya.</i>

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:43.650
<i>His knee must surely</i>
<i>be at its breaking-point!</i>

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:52.080
You have had a narrow escape.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:57.170
The...

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:59.000
The game is over!

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:03.220
The winner is Seishu Akoya.

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:05.720
Justice doesn't lose.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:08.470
I can't believe this...

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:09.890
Haru!

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:14.690
It's up to you, Haru, whether
you repent or keep falling.

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:18.230
You must make the decision on your own.

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.150
-Sen.
-I know.

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:23.360
He was outrageous as usual.

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:26.240
SEN HATSUMI, FIGHTER, NOGI GROUP
HIDEKI NOGI, CHAIRMAN, NOGI GROUP

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:28.280
He withstood every single attack
from that monster,

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:30.580
shifting the impact point every time.

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:32.750
<i>That's Seishu Akoya.</i>

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:36.120
<i>His defense is one of the hardest</i>
<i>to break of all the kengan fighters.</i>

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:40.210
<i>The Metropolitan Police Department keeps</i>
<i>an exceptional monster as its pet.</i>

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:41.960
Akoya!

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:46.680
Sorry, I panicked when he
made those unexpected moves

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:48.840
and my analysis was delayed.

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:51.890
I don't want any excuses.

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:56.390
You held me back. That's the truth of it.

00:21:56.890 --> 00:21:58.600
You've disappointed me, Hiyama.

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:01.650
I'll play the next match alone.

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:05.030
No... you can't do that, Akoya!

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:07.450
If you do that, you could...

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:12.910
Please, think it over.
I promise not to make any more mistakes.

00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:16.500
I'll do anything you want.

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:19.790
Don't abandon me. I'm begging you.

00:22:24.840 --> 00:22:26.170
I'll punish you later.

00:22:27.090 --> 00:22:29.260
This will be the last time
I forgive you, Hiyama.

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:35.180
Understood.

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:06.860
PREVIEW

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:09.230
<i>The successor to Baritsu,</i>
<i>the mythical martial art,</i>

00:24:09.320 --> 00:24:11.400
<i>fights an assassin from a taboo species.</i>

00:24:11.610 --> 00:24:15.280
<i>With pride running through each</i>
<i>family tree, which bloodline will survive?</i>

00:24:15.490 --> 00:24:18.120
<i>This match will be... an abnormal one.</i>

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:19.330
<i>Next episode: "Sister".</i>

00:24:19.410 --> 00:24:20.910
Subtitle translation by Hinako Someno
